LARD default wallpaper — `a_close_up_of_water.jpg`

"a close up of water" (dark ocean surface with foam), 5760x3840.

Provided by the LARD author for inclusion in LARD as the default wallpaper
(`assets/wallpapers/` in the source tree, `/usr/share/lard/wallpapers/` in the
package). The filename follows the Unsplash naming convention: if the photo
originated on Unsplash it is distributed under the Unsplash License (free to
use, including commercially, no attribution required):
https://unsplash.com/license

The legacy `lard-default.png` is an original procedural composition
(2560x1440, generated from gradients, radial glows and thin rings), released
under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
